            "title": "From the farm to the finished product",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "sp_lead_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>NANGA pursues high-quality down and manufacturing in Japan to create the finest down products. Here we report on the raw down that determines a product's performance, and on the refining technology, among the best in Japan, that brings that performance to its peak.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
