        },
        "sp_prof_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Founded in 1891, Kawada Feather is a down specialist and the first company in Japan to make down wear for skiing and everyday wear. It selects high-quality raw down from Japan and abroad, then washes and refines it at its own factories in Japan to deliver down that is safe, reliable, and clean.</p><p>More than a century of working with down has given the company its own techniques and know-how, and its technical strength has made it No. 1 in market share in Japan. Today it also recycles down as a renewable resource.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
